<h2>连接容器</h2>

<form method="post" action="/api/config/lx" hx-post="/api/config/lx" hx-target="#lx-save-msg">
  <article>
    <h3>连接 LXSyncServer</h3>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div><label>服务地址<input name="baseUrl" value="<%= cfg.lxserver.baseUrl %>" placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:19527"></label></div>
      <div>
        <label>API key</label>
        <div class="key-wrap">
          <input type="password" name="apiKey" id="lx-key" value="<%= cfg.lxserver.apiKey %>" autocomplete="off">
          <button type="button" class="btn-sm secondary key-eye" onclick="toggleKey('lx-key', this)" title="显示/隐藏">👁</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div><label>下载用户名（x-user-name）<input name="username" value="<%= cfg.lxserver.username %>"></label></div>
      <div>
        <label>LX 下载目录（本项目视角路径）
          <input name="downloadRoot" value="<%= cfg.lxserver.downloadRoot %>" placeholder="容器部署: /data/music；本机直跑: 宿主机路径">
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button type="submit">保存</button>
      <button type="button" class="secondary" hx-post="/api/test/lx" hx-target="#lx-test-result">测试连接</button>
      <span id="lx-test-result" class="msg"></span>
      <span id="lx-save-msg" class="msg"></span>
    </div>
  </article>
</form>
<div id="target-box" style="margin-top:.6rem">
  <h3>媒体服务器目标</h3>
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.2rem;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem"><input type="radio" name="target" value="emby" <%= cfg.target === 'emby' ? 'checked' : '' %> onclick="pickTarget('emby')"> Emby</label>
    <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem"><input type="radio" name="target" value="navidrome" <%= cfg.target === 'navidrome' ? 'checked' : '' %> onclick="pickTarget('navidrome')"> Navidrome</label>
    <span id="target-msg" class="msg"></span>
  </div>
  <p class="hint" style="margin:.4rem 0 0">同步入库 / 播放列表操作将指向所选服务器，下方仅显示对应连接框（两套配置均可保存）。切换后旧任务的目标播放列表来自另一服务器（会失效），建议切换前暂停任务、切换后重建任务。</p>
</div>


<div id="emby-box" style="display:<%= cfg.target === 'emby' ? '' : 'none' %>">
<form method="post" action="/api/config/emby" hx-post="/api/config/emby" hx-target="#emby-save-msg">
  <article>
    <h3>连接 Emby</h3>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div><label>服务地址<input name="baseUrl" value="<%= cfg.emby.baseUrl %>" placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:8096"></label></div>
      <div>
        <label>API key</label>
        <div class="key-wrap">
          <input type="password" name="apiKey" id="emby-key" value="<%= cfg.emby.apiKey %>" autocomplete="off">
          <button type="button" class="btn-sm secondary key-eye" onclick="toggleKey('emby-key', this)" title="显示/隐藏">👁</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="grid-column: span 2">
        <label>Emby 媒体库根路径（Emby 视角）
          <input name="libraryRoot" value="<%= cfg.emby.libraryRoot %>" placeholder="容器部署: /media/music；本机直跑: Emby 里显示的库路径">
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button type="submit">保存</button>
      <button type="button" class="secondary" hx-post="/api/test/emby" hx-target="#emby-test-result">测试连接</button>
      <button type="button" class="secondary" hx-post="/api/emby/probe" hx-target="#emby-probe-result">探测媒体库</button>
      <span id="emby-test-result" class="msg"></span>
      <span id="emby-probe-result" class="msg"></span>
      <span id="emby-save-msg" class="msg"></span>
    </div>
    <% if (cfg.emby.mediaLibraryId) { %>
      <p class="hint" style="margin:0">当前媒体库 Id: <code><%= cfg.emby.mediaLibraryId %></code></p>
    <% } %>
  </article>
</form>
</div>

<div id="nd-box" style="display:<%= cfg.target === 'navidrome' ? '' : 'none' %>">
<form method="post" action="/api/config/navidrome" hx-post="/api/config/navidrome" hx-target="#nd-save-msg">
  <article>
    <h3>连接 Navidrome</h3>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div><label>服务地址<input name="baseUrl" value="<%= cfg.navidrome.baseUrl %>" placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:4533"></label></div>
      <div>
        <label>账号密码（登录换 token）</label>
        <div class="key-wrap" style="gap:.3rem">
          <input name="username" value="<%= cfg.navidrome.username %>" placeholder="用户名" style="flex:1">
          <input type="password" name="password" id="nd-key" value="<%= cfg.navidrome.password %>" autocomplete="off" style="flex:1">
          <button type="button" class="btn-sm secondary key-eye" onclick="toggleKey('nd-key', this)" title="显示/隐藏">👁</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="grid-column: span 2">
        <label>媒体库根路径（Navidrome 视角；应等于 LX 下载目录在 Navidrome 容器内的路径）
          <input name="libraryRoot" value="<%= cfg.navidrome.libraryRoot %>" placeholder="如 /D8/MOVIEPILOT/MUSIC/MusicTagWeb/LINK/LXSERVER/king">
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button type="submit">保存</button>
      <button type="button" class="secondary" hx-post="/api/test/navidrome" hx-target="#nd-test-result">测试连接</button>
      <button type="button" class="secondary" hx-post="/api/navidrome/probe" hx-target="#nd-probe-result">探测媒体库</button>
      <span id="nd-test-result" class="msg"></span>
      <span id="nd-probe-result" class="msg"></span>
      <span id="nd-save-msg" class="msg"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="hint" style="margin:.3rem 0 0">Navidrome 无 API key，用普通账号密码登录（建议用专用低权限账号）。其媒体库根与 LX 下载目录同一共享目录、仅容器视角不同；歌曲入库由 Navidrome 自动监听完成。</p>
    <% if (cfg.navidrome.libraryId) { %>
      <p class="hint" style="margin:0">当前媒体库 Id: <code><%= cfg.navidrome.libraryId %></code></p>
    <% } %>
  </article>
</form>
</div>

<article>
  <h3>路径自检</h3>
  <div class="btn-row">
    <button type="button" class="secondary" hx-post="/api/paths/check" hx-target="#paths-result" hx-swap="innerHTML">运行路径自检</button>
    <span class="hint">检查下载目录可写、媒体库匹配情况，并给出路径关系提示</span>
  </div>
  <div id="paths-result" style="margin-top:.5rem"></div>
</article>

<details class="match-details">
  <summary>路径关系说明（部署必读）</summary>
  <div class="match-body">
    <p>SongFerry 与 LXSyncServer、Emby 三方共享<b>同一个音乐数据目录</b>，只是各容器内看到的路径不同：</p>
    <pre style="font-size:.82em;line-height:1.5;margin:.4rem 0"><code>宿主机 music-data（唯一真相源）
  ├── 挂给 lxserver → /server/music     LX 下载写这里
  ├── 挂给 Emby    → /media/music    媒体库扫描这里
  └── 挂给 本项目  → /data/music     本项目读/移动/洗版</code></pre>
    <p>界面里两个路径字段填的是<b>不同容器视角</b>的名字：</p>
    <ul class="match-rules">
      <li><b>LX 下载目录</b>：本项目容器内看到的路径（本项目要读写它）——Docker 填 <code>/data/music</code></li>
      <li><b>Emby 媒体库根</b>：你在 Emby 后台给该音乐媒体库选的<b>文件夹路径</b>（Emby 容器内视角，如 <code>/media/music/歌单同步</code>）——Emby 需先挂载共享目录并在后台建媒体库指向它，SongFerry 仅用于探测匹配</li>
      <li>下载目录与媒体库文件夹是同一目录的两个名字；漏挂任一方卷或媒体库指向别处，文件就不会出现在对应端</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="hint">本机直接运行（npm run dev）无容器视角差异，两处填宿主机实际路径即可。完整示例见 <code>docker-compose.example.yml</code>。</p>
  </div>
</details>
<script>
function pickTarget(t) {
  var m = document.getElementById('target-msg')
  document.getElementById('emby-box').style.display = t === 'emby' ? '' : 'none'
  document.getElementById('nd-box').style.display = t === 'navidrome' ? '' : 'none'
  if (m) m.innerHTML = '<span class="hint">切换中…</span>'
  fetch('/api/config/target', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' },
    body: 'target=' + t,
  })
    .then(function (r) { return r.text() })
    .then(function (html) { if (m) m.innerHTML = html })
    .catch(function (e) { if (m) m.innerHTML = '<span class="bad">切换失败：' + e + '</span>' })
}
function toggleKey(id, btn) {
  var el = document.getElementById(id)
  if (el.type === 'password') { el.type = 'text'; btn.textContent = '🙈' }
  else { el.type = 'password'; btn.textContent = '👁' }
}
</script>
